{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multiprofile RNA-only model using the scvi_n200 encoder and avgpool aggregation, building on the singleprofile scvi_n200 baseline (config_002). Validation accuracy of 0.650 (vs. 0.520 in config_002) and F1 of 0.628 suggest improved performance, indicating potential benefits from multiprofile data and avgpool aggregation. However, the exact contribution of these factors remains uncertain due to lack of isolated comparison, and the role of other design choices like fusion strategies is unexplored."
}

